\\theta \\\\ &=\\int_{0}^{\\pi}\\int_0^{\\sqrt{6}}(r)^{2}\\cdot \\cos(\\theta)((r)^{2}\\cdot (\\cos(\\theta))^{2}+20\\cdot r\\cdot \\cos(\\theta)+100-((r)^{2}\\cdot (\\cos(\\theta))^{2}))\\,dr\\,d\\theta \\\\ &=\\int_{0}^{\\pi}\\int_0^{\\sqrt{6}}20\\cdot (r)^{3}\\cdot (\\cos(\\theta))^{2}+100\\cdot (r)^{2}\\cdot \\cos(\\theta)\\,dr\\,d\\theta \\\\ &=\\int_{0}^{\\pi}[5\\cdot (r)^{4}\\cdot (\\cos(\\theta))^{2}+\\frac{100}{3}\\cdot (r)^{3}\\cdot \\cos(\\theta)]_{r=0}^{r=\\sqrt{6}}\\,d\\theta \\\\ &=\\int_{0}^{\\pi}(5\\cdot ((\\sqrt{6}))^{4}\\cdot (\\cos(\\theta))^{2})-(5\\cdot ((0))^{4}\\cdot (\\cos(\\theta))^{2})+(\\frac{100}{3}\\cdot ((\\sqrt{6}))^{3}\\cdot \\cos(\\theta))-(\\frac{100}{3}\\cdot ((0))^{3}\\cdot \\cos(\\theta))\\,d\\theta \\\\ &=\\int_{0}^{\\pi}(180\\cdot (\\cos(\\theta))^{2})-(0)+(200\\cdot \\sqrt{6}\\cdot \\cos(\\theta))-(0)\\,d\\theta \\\\ &=\\int_{0}^{\\pi}180\\cdot (\\cos(\\theta))^{2}+200\\cdot \\sqrt{6}\\cdot \\cos(\\theta)\\,d\\theta \\\\ &=\\int_{0}^{\\pi}180(\\frac{1}{2}(1+\\cos(2\\cdot \\theta)))+200\\cdot \\sqrt{6}\\cdot \\cos(\\theta)\\,d\\theta \\\\ &=\\int_{0}^{\\pi}200\\cdot \\sqrt{6}\\cdot \\cos(\\theta)+90\\cdot \\cos(2\\cdot \\theta)+90\\,d\\theta \\\\ &=[90\\cdot \\theta+200\\cdot \\sqrt{6}\\cdot \\sin(\\theta)+45\\cdot \\sin(2\\cdot \\theta)]_{\\theta=0}^{\\theta=\\pi} \\\\ &=(90\\cdot \\pi)-(0)+(0)-(0)+(0)-(0) \\\\ &=90\\cdot \\pi\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535921 17592186045443 true] [17592186542405 1080 "\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot \\pi" 13194139535921 17592186045443 true] [17592186542405 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535921 17592186045443 true] [17592186542405 1083 #uuid "b6ca9be8-5d2e-57ab-a777-f3c7100f1c02" 13194139535921 17592186045443 true] [17592186542406 1075 #edb/ref 17592186542374 13194139535921 17592186045443 true] [17592186542406 1075 #edb/ref 17592186542376 13194139535921 17592186045443 true] [17592186542406 1075 #edb/ref 17592186542377 13194139535921 17592186045443 true] [17592186542406 1075 #edb/ref 17592186542402 13